        <p class="bb-apex-audience__body">Paper sign-ups and outdated sheets make it hard to see real congregation activity.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bb-apex-audience__card">
        <span class="bb-apex-audience__icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">group_off</span></span>
